warning[L0807]: `inner` is read only by definitions that nothing reachable reads
 --> lint/unreachable_chain.knv:1:7
  |
1 | (defn inner (x) (* x 2))
  |       ^^^^^ read only by definitions that nothing reachable reads
2 |
3 | (defn outer (x) (inner x))
  |       ----- read by this definition, which nothing reachable reads
  |
  = help: remove it together with `outer`, which is reported too
  = note: run `knave doc L0807` for an explanation

warning[L0807]: `outer` is never used
 --> lint/unreachable_chain.knv:3:7
  |
3 | (defn outer (x) (inner x))
  |       ^^^^^ never used
  |
  = help: remove the definition, or export it if another module needs it
  = note: run `knave doc L0807` for an explanation
